# Dependencies and build output (installed/built inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/generated
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and logs. A local .env.production could otherwise end up in the
# dashboard build, where Vite compiles every VITE_ value into the bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log

# Not needed to build or run a service
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig
.claude
.playwright-mcp
.pnpm-store
docs
scripts
infrastructure
**/test
**/*.md

# OS generated
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/__MACOSX
